      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "From the time I approached Thomas at Effective Electrical I received nothing but excellent service: excellent advice regarding the system we had installed, prompt and efficient quotation and efficient installation. Due to power supply problems from the mains the system did not operate effectively. This was no fault of Effective Electrical, but a main supply issue. Regardless of this Effective Electrical made the necessary contact to solve the problem immediately. Furthermore their assistance in supplying me with the necessary documentation to apply for the government grant was excellent. As many as four or more times I had to call on them for assistance in this matter. That assistance was happily and speedily provided. I am totally satisfied the system they installed and would recommend Effective Electrical to all potential customers.",
